re-expresses its 2D rotary position embedding with a static table; the
upstream code is fetched unmodified by Forge/depth/fetch_upstream.py. The
depth-anything/DA3-SMALL weights are not part of this repository; the
exported bundle carries their Apache-2.0 license and a modification NOTICE.

YOLOX (https://github.com/Megvii-BaseDetection/YOLOX, commit
6ddff4824372906469a7fae2dc3206c7aa4bbaee), Apache License 2.0, copyright (c)
2021-2022 Megvii Inc. Forge/yolox/yolox_graphs.py wraps upstream YOLOX.forward
