their Apache-2.0 license and a modification NOTICE. The COCO class names in
Sources/AetherVision/Detection.swift are upstream's COCO_CLASSES.
Gemma is provided under and subject to the Gemma Terms of Use found at
ai.google.dev/gemma/terms. EmbeddingGemma (google/embeddinggemma-300m, revision
57c266a740f537b4dc058e1b0cda161fd15afa75), by Google DeepMind:
Forge/embeddinggemma/embeddinggemma_graphs.py re-expresses its
sentence-transformers pipeline (mean pooling, two dense layers, L2
normalization) around transformers' Gemma3TextModel as one export graph, and
