HuggingFace Team), each under the Apache License 2.0.
Forge/rfdetr/rfdetr_graphs.py wraps upstream LWDETR's inference graph (the
DINOv2 backbone, the projector and the two-stage transformer decoder, with
ImageNet normalization folded in and grid sampling decomposed into gathers) as
an export graph; Sources/AetherVision/DetrHead.swift restates upstream's
rfdetr.models.postprocess.PostProcess (sigmoid, top-k over query and class
