are not part of this repository; the exported bundles carry their Apache-2.0
license and a modification NOTICE.

OpenAI CLIP (https://github.com/openai/CLIP), MIT License, copyright (c) 2021
OpenAI. Sources/AetherRuntime/Text/CLIPTokenizer.swift re-expresses its
byte-level BPE tokenizer: the pre-tokenization pattern, the byte-to-unicode
table and the end-of-word merge rule. Forge/clip/clip_graphs.py wraps the
openai/clip-vit-base-patch32 checkpoint's image and text towers (transformers'
CLIPModel) as export graphs with the input normalization and the output L2
normalization folded in. The weights are not part of this repository; the
exported bundle (aether-models/aether-kit-clip-vit-b32) carries openai/CLIP's
MIT LICENSE and a modification NOTICE.

GLiNER2 (https://github.com/fastino-ai/GLiNER2, gliner2 2.0.0, tag v2.0.0,
commit 3c913c7369301133d3b7699252074c4303ada50e), Apache License 2.0, by
Fastino (maintainer Urchade Zaratiana). Forge/gliner/gliner_graphs.py wraps
the classification path of the fastino/GLiNER2.5-Decide checkpoint
(transformers' DebertaV2Model encoder, the [L] marker gather and gliner2's
classifier head) as an export graph with DeBERTa's relative-position table
precomputed, and runs gliner2's own classify_text as the reference; the
unmodified release wheel is fetched by Forge/gliner/fetch_upstream.py and
imported read-only. The GLiNER2.5-Decide weights (Apache-2.0, on
microsoft/deberta-v3-large, MIT) are not part of this repository; the exported
bundle carries their Apache-2.0 license and a modification NOTICE.

kokoro (https://github.com/hexgrad/kokoro, version 0.9.4), Apache License 2.0,
copyright hexgrad. Forge/kokoro/kokoro_graphs.py re-expresses its KModel
(the ALBERT duration predictor, prosody predictor and iSTFTNet decoder,
including SineGen's harmonic source) as export graphs; the unmodified package
is fetched by Forge/kokoro/fetch_upstream.py and read only as the reference.
Kokoro-82M weights and voices are not part of this repository; the exported
