Hugging Face Transformers (https://github.com/huggingface/transformers,
version 4.57.3), Apache License 2.0, copyright The HuggingFace Team. Outputs
recorded from it serve as test oracles: its logits processors' results
(Tests/AetherRuntimeTests/Fixtures/transformers-warpers.json) and its chat
templates' rendered token ids
(Tests/AetherTextTests/Fixtures/chat-oracle/chat-oracle.json,
olmo2-chat-oracle.json). Forge/h3/export_h3.py re-expresses its Qwen3-VL vision
tower forward (Qwen3VLVisionModel) as an export graph.
Forge's exporters use Transformers 5.22.1 (Forge/pyproject.toml):
Forge/qwen3/qwen3_graphs.py re-expresses Qwen3ForCausalLM's dense decoder,
and Forge/qwen3vl/qwen3vl_graphs.py Qwen3VLForConditionalGeneration's vision
tower, merger, DeepStack injection and M-RoPE decoder, and
Forge/qwen3_5/qwen3_5_graphs.py Qwen3_5ForConditionalGeneration's vision tower
and hybrid decoder (its gated delta rule, gated attention and interleaved
M-RoPE), as export graphs; Forge/krea2/krea2_graphs.py re-expresses Qwen3VLModel's image-conditioned
text-encoder forward (encodeWithImages), and
Sources/AetherRuntime/Vision/ImagePrompt.swift its multimodal rotary position
rule.

